\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par Christ, the royal Master,
\par Leads against the foe;
\par Foward into battle,
\par See! His banners go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. At the sign of triumph
\par Satan's host doth flee;
\par On then, Christian soldiers,
\par On to victory!
\par Hell's foundations quiver
\par At the shout of praise;
\par Brothers, lift your voices,
\par Loud your anthems raise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Like a mighty army
\par Moves the Church of God;
\par Brothers, we are treading
\par Where the saints have trod.
\par We are not divided,
\par All one body we,
\par One in hope, in docterine,
\par One in charity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Crowns and thrones may perish,
\par Kingdoms rise and wane,
\par But the Church of Jesus
\par Constant will remain.
\par Gates of hell can never
\par 'Gainst that Church prevail;
\par We have Christ's own promise,
\par And that cannot fail.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Onward then, ye people!
\par Join our happy throng;
\par Blend with ours your voices
\par In the triumph song:
\par Glory, laud, and honour
\par Unto Christ the King!
\par This through countless ages
\par Men and angels sing.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers,
\par Marching as to war,
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

